  "identifier": "kimetsu-tv-rerun-2026",
  "headline": "Demon Slayer TV series reruns begin April 5, 2026 on Fuji TV",
  "description": "Fuji TV will rebroadcast the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba TV series starting April 5, 2026, airing Sundays at 9:30 a.m. The rerun begins with the Tanjiro Kamado, Unwavering Resolve arc.",
  "articleBody": "Japanese outlets report that the Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba TV series will be rebroadcast beginning April 5, 2026. The schedule places the show in Fuji TV's Sunday 9:30 a.m. time slot.\n\nThe rerun starts from the Tanjiro Kamado, Unwavering Resolve arc and will continue through the series in order. The timing gives viewers a chance to catch up on the story while the franchise moves toward its next phase.\n\nFuji TV's broadcast page confirms the weekly Sunday slot and marks the return as a nationwide rebroadcast event.",
